9 Repeat the washing process (centrifuging, discarding and resuspending) five times with DIW (the total number of washing cycles is five).
CRITICAL STEP A small volume of ethanol ( ${\cdot}^{\infty\ \mathrm{mL}}$ ) can be added along with DIW for each washing process to ensure the formation of pellet at the bottom of the tube.
0 After five washing cycles, finely grind the ZIF-8 pellet in a mortar and pestle while keeping it moist with DIW.
